      "updated": 1780935419463,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Can handle 10 request per/second. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Can handle 10 request per/second. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Z_E6_q71bsP_EXBrNgUMm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1107.2379539126425,
      "y": 3241.016044132294,
      "width": 455.5596923828125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 395505567,
      "version": 173,
      "versionNonce": 593308959,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780935494621,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Want to handle more then 10k request/second.\n-> Latency increase\n-> Throughput decrease\n-> Single point of failure ( sever crashed)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Want to handle more then 10k request/second.\n-> Latency increase\n-> Throughput decrease\n-> Single point of failure ( sever crashed)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "o0VPrIfQNU591Ps8CRYr7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100.9879539126425,
      "y": 3371.016044132294,
      "width": 552.5596313476562,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1620290527,
      "version": 77,
      "versionNonce": 1038695775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780935558687,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution -> vertical scaling of server ( increase ram etc) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution -> vertical scaling of server ( increase ram etc) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-bGzfq7PaE679wG68SUeZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1112.654595147994,
      "y": 3394.34936474997,
      "width": 280.71978759765625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1942147281,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 1890350961,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780935647095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> reduce latency\n-> throughput increasing\n-> Still single point of failure",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> reduce latency\n-> throughput increasing\n-> Still single point of failure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1Z0ISBAWlxYDYXZ7FRCi7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1107.169395046629,
      "y": 3596.84936474997,
      "width": 828.4561157226562,
      "height": 235.25642981895967,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1302247057,
      "version": 570,
      "versionNonce": 64142193,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780935889565,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Want to handle more then 10M request/second\n-> again increase latency\n-> throughput increasing\n-> single point of failure\n\nSolution -> Vertical scaling of server ( not possible it has some limit + increase more cost)\nsolution -> Horizontal scaling ( Increase number of server)\n-> reduce latency\n-> throughput increasing\n-> no single point of failure.",
      "fontSize": 18.820514385516773,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Want to handle more then 10M request/second\n-> again increase latency\n-> throughput increasing\n-> single point of failure\n\nSolution -> Vertical scaling of server ( not possible it has some limit + increase more cost)\nsolution -> Horizontal scaling ( Increase number of server)\n-> reduce latency\n-> throughput increasing\n-> no single point of failure.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
