    {
      "id": "ZRXfKcM2lcQ-sckbIm8_L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1104.7379539126425,
      "y": 4100.599345676484,
      "width": 993.75927734375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 989224467,
      "version": 488,
      "versionNonce": 1312407123,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780974285997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Number of request = 10M /second\n9M/second DB read request.\n1M/Second DB write request.\n\nPostgress and other DB right now capable of handling millions of read and write without any problem.\nBut still, \n-> increase latency \n-> drop throughput.\n-> DB can be single point of failure ( sopf = not only means crash but it can be also disaster)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Number of request = 10M /second\n9M/second DB read request.\n1M/Second DB write request.\n\nPostgress and other DB right now capable of handling millions of read and write without any problem.\nBut still, \n-> increase latency \n-> drop throughput.\n-> DB can be single point of failure ( sopf = not only means crash but it can be also disaster)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
